# Reading Shopee prices (app/core/parsing.py), when someone signs in. Shopee only
# shows products to a signed-in browser: paste the Cookie header of a logged-in
# shopee.vn tab (devtools > Network > any shopee.vn request > Request Headers >
# cookie), e.g. "SPC_EC=…; SPC_U=…; …". When it expires the log says
# "asked to sign in" and prices stop updating until it's replaced.
SHOPEE_COOKIES=
# Where the price is on the page; default div.pyzxvq.pw3J3G. Shopee's class names
# change when they redeploy their site: put the new one here when prices stop
SHOPEE_PRICE_SELECTOR=
